#compdef ztag

# Tag the current shell session with one or more labels. `ztag prod-
# deploy`. Other shells can filter by tag via `zls --tag prod-
# deploy`.
#
# zshrs builtin. Registered in ZSHRS_BUILTIN_NAMES
# (daemon/builtins.rs); takes no sub-commands.
# Bundled into ~/.zshrs/functions by build.rs.

# No sub-commands: fall through to the default completer so
# file/parameter arguments still complete.
_default
